{
  "slug": "waggle",
  "name": "Waggle",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Waggle is a search engine for AI agents that implement Google's A2A (Agent-to-Agent) protocol. This plugin lets Claude discover agents by capability and invoke them directly from your conversation.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `find-and-invoke` (Waggle — Find and invoke the best A2A agent for a task), `invoke-agent` (Waggle — Invoke a specific A2A agent by URL, skipping search), `register-agent` (Waggle — Register a new A2A agent for indexing and discovery), `search-agents` (Waggle — Search for A2A agents by capability, use case, or keyword)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `waggle`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install waggle@claude-community` from `Waggle-AI/waggle-claude-code-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 4,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
